rgin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-email-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Email this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47958580.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-sms-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Text this Story\"></a></td></tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0;border-bottom:10px solid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      \r\n<tr><td height=\"20\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ol-adpad\" style=\"padding: 20px 3.5% 0 3.5%;\"><p class=\"b\"\r\nstyle=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100% !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; font-size: 11px !important; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: #008dc8; font-weight:700;\"\r\n>\r\nA MESSAGE FROM AXIOS\r\n</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 3.5%; line-height: 1.5;\"><span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size: 26px; color: #222222;  font-family: 'gorditamedium', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  letter-spacing: -0.1px; line-height: 1.5;\">Find where your team is misaligned</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47958580.428448/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuc21hcnRicmV2aXR5LmNvbS9zaW1wbGlmeS10cmFpbmluZz91dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249c2ltcGxpZnktd29ya3Nob3AmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1heGlvcy1maW5pc2gtbGluZSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXItYWQmdXRtX2NvbnRlbnQ9d29ya3Nob3AtYm9vayZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB64f6191e\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://images.axios.com/Frtiwe0Ep1vvM7X9iDHdzEyFu6I=/2026/10/08/1791490360635.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" /></a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"15\" style=\"height: 15px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.75;  font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Simplify Workshop</strong> shows your team where it is misaligned and why it keeps happening.</p><p>Everyone leaves with one aligned set of priorities and a real kill list, built on the Confront, Delete, Amplify method. The whole team works through it together.</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47958580.428448/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuc21hcnRicmV2aXR5LmNvbS9zaW1wbGlmeS10cmFpbmluZz91dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249c2ltcGxpZnktd29ya3Nob3AmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1heGlvcy1maW5pc2gtbGluZSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXItYWQmdXRtX2NvbnRlbnQ9d29ya3Nob3AtYm9vayZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC64f6191e\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more about the Workshop</a></strong></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 👋 Kindness to go! </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td> <img src=\"https://images.axios.com/Pg4i7C7_f_DRSKC6mq6Qp48-b6Y=/1920x1080/smart/2021/12/20/212921-1640035761900.jpg\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" id=\"item03\" alt=\"Illustration of a chalkboard with a waving hand emoji drawn on it.\"> </td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.3\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#848484\"> <p>Illustration: Allie Carl/Axios</p> </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><p><strong>Doing good can be </strong>refreshingly simple — like this example from reader Ray Cunningham of Issaquah, Wash., who turned a random act of kindness into a habit:</p><ul><li><strong>\"Whenever I'm out for a run,</strong> I give a wave to everyone whom I meet along the way, whether they are walking, running or cycling. Just a simple acknowledgment that we're in this together as a community. I've noticed over time that many of those who've seen me before start giving me waves back.\"</li></ul></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47958580.428448/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNGNlMjk3NTgtYTI0My00MDIzLWE4MTgtNTYyZjY3ZmU0MWUwLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCe91889cf\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47958580.428448/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_dGV4dD0lRjAlOUYlOTElOEIlMjBLaW5kbmVzcyUyMHRvJTIwZ28lMjEmaGFzaHRhZ3M9YXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnVybD1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNGNlMjk3NTgtYTI0My00MDIzLWE4MTgtNTYyZjY3ZmU0MWUwLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0R0d3NvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCc439ec9d\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axio